{"reviews":[{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-0","r":5.0,"t":"Shaped perfectly","x":"Very nice tips easy to apply in file for a perfect set","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-1","r":5.0,"t":"Saves so much time on service, perfect salon length nails","x":"Love these! They save me so much time on my service! No need to cut down, they are perfect salon length nails. Easy to shape too.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-2","r":5.0,"t":"Short Nail Tips","x":"Love love love! Saved time and the perfect length for SHORT sets. I ordered the clear tips and will definitely be ordering again. Sturdy and sizes 0-9. Case included. Affordable & Fast shipping","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-3","r":5.0,"t":"GET THEM","x":"I used them for shorties and love them !!!!! I didn't cut anything they perfect","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-4","r":4.0,"t":"So far so good.","x":"I didn\u2019t appreciate how they came packaged. It could be in better packaging. Tips are kinda thrown everywhere. Despite the packaging , the nails seems sturdy and I\u2019m very pleased with sizing and length. I will update and add pictures once I do my nails.  Update : May 11 2022. I love these and will more than likely repurchase.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-5","r":3.0,"t":"Eh. Mixed feeling about this one.","x":"[[VIDEOID:b0182a482fb5756093e08e51a8c5da41]] Smaller sizes doesnt have as many as the larger sizes. The entire bottom row is just a mix of thumbs and small sizes.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-6","r":5.0,"t":"Works well!","x":"These tips work really well i I didn\u2019t have any problems putting them on. They are very durable. I\u2019ve had them on for 2 weeks now and they are holding up great!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-7","r":5.0,"t":"They actually last!","x":"I bought these along with an acrylic powder set and they work so well! I work in a factory setting with my hands all day. These actually last for a couple weeks without breaking off. The acrylic lifts before the tips give me any issues. FIVE STARS!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-8","r":5.0,"t":"Love love love","x":"[[VIDEOID:f7c3ead962e6146b6deb746dd8ba7338]] I highly recommend these tips!! Very easy to apply and could be used as tip overlay with acrylic and gel. Cuts down time because these tips are already precut. Just size and glue !","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-9","r":5.0,"t":"Good for beginners","x":"I loved these tips, I have a full set on right now. They look good. I haven't done any polish or designs yet, but I like them.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-10","r":4.0,"t":"Short nail must have","x":"I use these nail tips for an acrylic set, love that they are short so you don't waste your long nail tips.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-11","r":5.0,"t":"Worked perfectly","x":"These tips done great for me to use poly gel on!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-12","r":5.0,"t":"Loved!","x":"[[VIDEOID:a31e255ecc327262d1efa215d71f28a4]]","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-13","r":5.0,"t":"Like Them!","x":"I like these nail tips for two reasons.  First, I like that they are short & do not require cutting. But, being quite short. they can sometimes be a bit harder to attach because there isn\u2019t much to hang onto.  Secondly, they are not thick.  This makes them easier to buff & blend onto your own nail surface.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-14","r":1.0,"t":"Took a chance. Big regret","x":"I literally just received this and it\u2019s going back. I took a chance because I thought this might help speed up short sets. You don\u2019t get 500 pieces. Miss sizes are unusable they\u2019re so tiny. And they either misnumbered tips or put them in the wrong slots. Wrong order again","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-15","r":4.0,"t":"Most common shape and length","x":"I love these cute short nails they are great because they are already shaped. I was kind of a challenge to put them on with my nails being longer. However they were not impossible. I would definitely recommend these nails for beginners and  Advanced nail techs.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-16","r":3.0,"t":"Not good quality","x":"Some came already like chipped & arent quite sturdy.. i prob didnt grab the correct size some fit too small others a lil big. I wouldn't buy it again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-17","r":4.0,"t":"Perfect short nails","x":"These nails are perfect for ladies that enjoy wearing short nail. The perfect length, your not wasting tips and perfect shape.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-18","r":5.0,"t":"Can't recommend this product enough","x":"I typically do not use nail tips as part of my nail design, however after using this product I will always use these tips. The length of the product is perfect, and it is very easy to cut them down to the length you prefer. The glue well is perfectly sized and makes a nice transition to the nail bed. The C - Curve is perfect, and the additional strength added makes for the ideal manicure. I cannot recommend this product enough.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-19","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE","x":"I have done my own acrylic nails coming up to 3 years now and wanted to up my game and learn how to apply fake nail tips. I love having short fake nails rather than long. These are PERFECT. I still clip them a little, but not much and size wise I had sizes that fit perfectly on every nail! I'll be buying these again once I run out. (Sorry about my bad paint job on my thumb, was my first time doing a strip design lol)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-20","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty thin but they work fine","x":"Tried to prepare it with the dehydrator and it ripped in 2 like a contact lense! But they stick on fine wo any preparation + reg nail glue. Also they have several large thumb sizes and tiny pinkie sizes but not nearly that many options for the middle fingers but I made it work bc I like a short stiletto/ almond shape , so I just filed down on the sides which is what I would do anyways.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-21","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t buy!!!","x":"I have had these fake tips for about three months now, and I kept thinking it was my nail drill, my nail glue, so I bought things to adjust to these tips, and it just DID NOT WORK. The strongest glue and the best drill could not make these tips works. They constantly break, super thin plastic, and over all a waste of money.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-22","r":5.0,"t":"Nice","x":"Very nice they are not thin but work well I recommend it good for a quick fix meaning if one has a nail that breaks well put on one of these as a quick fix although I would rather have the full size ones which I did get I just wanted to try these out and they are ok even for the price.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-23","r":1.0,"t":"A waste of time and money","x":"I should have listen to the negative reviews. These tips don\u2019t stick no matter what I do. I used my nail drill to rough up the surface to insure adhesion, and they would not stick. Not even using different glues helped. Don\u2019t waste your time or money.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08ZJ6FQQD-24","r":1.0,"t":"Does it need a specific glue or im bugging?","x":"Boy! It took me 2 hrs to get them to stick. My first time using the short ones and they would not stick to my clients nails. Is there a specific glue I must use? Because I tried two different brand name glues. That was embarrassing","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise these tips for saving time, since they are pre-cut and require no trimming for short sets.","cites":[2,3,9,14]},{"text":"Many customers find the tips sturdy and durable, holding up for weeks even with heavy hand use.","cites":[3,5,7,8]},{"text":"The short, salon-ready length is widely appreciated as perfect for short sets without wasting long tips.","cites":[2,3,4,11,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers complain about sizing and packaging problems, including too few small sizes and tips thrown loosely in the case.","cites":[5,6,15]},{"text":"Some users note the very short tips can be harder to hold and attach because there is little to grip.","cites":[14]}]},"qa":[]}